==Bursting/Barraging TzHaar-Ket==
{{Map|name=TzHaar-Ket-Rak|x=2545|y=5110|zoom=2|mapID=23|r=3|align=right|width=200|height=200|}}
TzHaar-Ket have a relatively low magic level and a +0 magic defence boost. Therefore, players who have defeated [[TzTok-Jad]] and posses a fire cape can opt to burst/barrage TzHaar-Ket within the inner area of [[Mor Ul Rek]]. The best location to do this is near the [[TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Challenges]] minigame.  In this area, the TzHaar-Ket heavily outnumber the TzHaar-Mej and Tzhaar-Xil, so the player can avoid all damage by using the [[Protect from Melee]] prayer. 

The most effective method for grouping Tzhaar-Ket is to use a fast Ranged weapon (such as cheap darts or knives) to draw their aggression. A faster way to group them is to drink a [[Goading potion]] or to use [[Dinh's bulwark]] special attack, but these methods can risk aggroing the TzHaar-Xil in the area. 
